GET http://localhost:8080/depositor-policies
Content-Type: application/json

### Depositors
GET http://localhost:8080/depositor-policies/depositors
Content-Type: application/json

### Policies of one depositor
GET http://localhost:8080/depositor-policies/amz
Content-Type: application/json

### Create or update a policy
POST http://localhost:8080/depositor-policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "depositorId": "amz",
  "key": "replenishment-minimum",
  "type": "REPLENISHMENT",
  "text": "Replenishment orders for Amazon must contain at least 500 units per product. Amazon consolidates smaller requests and may delay them by an entire week.",
  "attributes": {
    "minimumQuantity": 500
  }
}

### What the agent retrieves
GET http://localhost:8080/depositor-policies/amz/preview?question=What are the constraints to request 500 units today?
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete a policy
DELETE http://localhost:8080/depositor-policies/amz/replenishment-minimum
Content-Type: application/json
